{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51409","headline":"忧旱吟 · 张祜","name":"忧旱吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎熇肆蒸溽，南薫日飘扬。\n田畴苦焦烈，龟坼无润壤。\n嘉禾穟爲实，灌注期穰穰。\n午火云炽，虐焰弥穹苍。\n桔槹置无用，何计盈仓箱。\n老农力耕耨，扪心热衷肠。\n公租与私税，焉得俱无伤？\n今年已憔悴，斗米百钱偿。\n富豪索高价，闭廪几绝粮。\n引领望甘雨，倾城祷林桑。\n匹夫动天地，奚俟暴巫尫。\n浃旬竟弗验，神明果茫茫。\n彼苍岂降割，以重吾民殃。\n（《古今图书集成·庶徵典》五九《旱灾部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}